## Usage

{% if output_mode == 'terraform' %}
Run `terraform init`, `terraform plan`, and `terraform apply` from this repository root.
{% elif backend == 'prometheus' %}
Deploy `prometheus/rules/` to your Prometheus ruler and sync `prometheus/alertmanager/`
via GitOps. Map receivers to **{{ notification_target }}** in your real Alertmanager
config.
{% elif backend == 'grafana' %}
Import JSON from `grafana/dashboards/` via Grafana UI/API or GitOps.
{% elif backend == 'datadog' %}
Import monitor JSON from `datadog/monitors/` via the Datadog API or internal GitOps.
{% elif backend == 'otel' %}
Run or deploy `otel/collector-config.yaml` with the OpenTelemetry Collector distribution
you standardize on; extend exporters beyond `logging` for production.
{% endif %}

## Validate locally

Use the repave gate toolchain ([`deploy/local`](https://github.com/opsdevcode/repave/tree/main/deploy/local))
or Docker Compose so dry-run and `repave gates` match CI.

```bash
yamllint .
{% if backend == 'prometheus' and output_mode == 'native' %}
promtool check rules prometheus/rules/*.yaml
{% endif %}
{% if output_mode == 'terraform' %}
terraform fmt -check
terraform validate
{% endif %}
```

## Gates

Repave publish runs blueprint gates. **Dry run preview** fails (does not skip) when a required
CLI is missing — install Terraform, Conftest, Checkov, and peers from the repave local deploy docs.

| Gate | When |
| --- | --- |
| `yamllint` | YAML under this repo |
| `promtool` | `prometheus/rules/*.yaml` (Prometheus native) |
| `opa` | Native JSON/YAML globs or Terraform plan JSON / fixtures |
| `secrets` | Scans for leaked credentials |
| `docs-drift` | README / standard alignment |
| `provenance-drift` | `repave.yaml` metadata |

Terraform mode adds `terraform-fmt`, `terraform-validate`, and related gates when `.tf` files exist.

## Provenance

Generation metadata lives in `repave.yaml`. The `provenance-drift` gate validates it on
every generate/publish.
